+/**
+ * Regression test for CVE-2026-34359 (CWE-346, Origin Validation Error).
+ *
+ * SimpleHTTPClient followed HTTP redirects and re-attached the Basic-auth
+ * Authorization header on any hop that shared a host name, leaking credentials
+ * to a look-alike host such as tx.fhir.org.attacker.com or across a scheme
+ * downgrade / port change.
